    },
    {
      "problem": "Explosion was clipped to a horizontal strip by soft intersections against the floor.",
      "fix": "Capture signed DG_PRIM.raise on all authenticated particle allocations and use it only for compositing/intersection depth, on both original-artwork and fallback paths. World geometry, damage, timing and native GPU commands remain unchanged.",
